      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners across Chicago praise the reliability, punctuality, and dedication of the walkers and owners Ryan and Caroline. Reviewers frequently highlight walkers like Kyle, Rebecca, Patricia, and Nicole for treating dogs with genuine warmth. Clients note that team members build trust quickly and remain dependable, even when navigating demanding schedules."
