      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough updates and photo reports"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Communication is consistently cited as one of the standout features of this walking service. Pet parents emphasize receiving detailed text messages, walk summaries, and photos after every single outing. Clients also appreciate weekly schedule confirmations and quick responsiveness from the owners whenever adjustments or cancellations arise."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient attention for senior dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Handling of dogs with special behavioral and medical needs receives enthusiastic commendation. Pet owners report that walkers take the time to visit homes beforehand, helping shy, timid, or senior dogs warm up without pressure. Reviewers highlight that their dogs visibly look forward to walk arrivals, providing owners with complete peace of mind."
      }
    }
